        {
          "textRaw": "[m] exec",
          "name": "[m]_exec",
          "methods": [
            {
              "textRaw": "terminal.exec(command, options?)",
              "type": "method",
              "name": "exec",
              "desc": "<p><strong><code>6.8.0</code></strong> <strong><code>Non-UI</code></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>command</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a> } - 非空命令, 最多 64 KiB UTF-8</li>\n<li><strong>[ options ]</strong> { <a href=\"terminalOpenOptionsType#terminalexecoptions\">TerminalExecOptions</a> }</li>\n<li><ins><strong>returns</strong></ins> { <a href=\"terminalSessionType\">TerminalSession</a> }</li>\n</ul>\n<p>在新会话中执行命令. 默认 <code>show: true</code>, <code>keepOpen: true</code>, <code>wait: false</code>. 命令结束后默认保留交互式 shell. 设置 <code>wait: true</code> 会等待整个会话退出, 因此等待命令退出码时应同时设置 <code>keepOpen: false</code>. <code>timeout</code> 默认 600000 ms, <code>0</code> 表示不限时. 超时会抛出 <code>TIMEOUT</code>, 会话继续运行, 可查询或显式关闭.</p>\n",
              "signatures": [
                {
                  "params": [
                    {
                      "name": "command"
                    },
                    {
                      "name": "options?"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "type": "module",
          "displayName": "[m] exec"
        },
        {
          "textRaw": "[m] execAsync",
          "name": "[m]_execasync",
          "methods": [
            {
              "textRaw": "terminal.execAsync(command, options?)",
              "type": "method",
              "name": "execAsync",
              "desc": "<p><strong><code>6.8.0</code></strong> <strong><code>Async</code></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>command</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a> }</li>\n<li><strong>[ options ]</strong> { <a href=\"terminalOpenOptionsType#terminalexecoptions\">TerminalExecOptions</a> }</li>\n<li><ins><strong>returns</strong></ins> { <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Global_Objects/Promise\">Promise</a>&lt;<a href=\"terminalSessionType\">TerminalSession</a>&gt; }</li>\n</ul>\n<p><a href=\"#m-exec\">exec</a> 的异步形态. <code>wait: false</code> 时 Promise 在会话建立后完成, <code>wait: true</code> 时等待会话退出.</p>\n",
              "signatures": [
                {
                  "params": [
                    {
                      "name": "command"
                    },
                    {
                      "name": "options?"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
