          "type": "module",
          "displayName": "[m] execAsync"
        },
        {
          "textRaw": "[p+] npm",
          "name": "[p+]_npm",
          "properties": [
            {
              "textRaw": "terminal.npm",
              "name": "npm",
              "desc": "<p>提供 npm 脚本执行方法. 需要安装签名可信的 Node.js Runtime 1.5.0 或更新版本, 并在 3-Shell Terminal 设置中开启 Node.js 集成. 该功能不会安装依赖或绕过 Android 对应用私有目录中可执行文件的限制.</p>\n"
            }
          ],
          "modules": [
            {
              "textRaw": "terminal.npm.run(script, directory?, options?)",
              "name": "terminal.npm.run(script,_directory?,_options?)",
              "desc": "<p><strong><code>6.8.0</code></strong> <strong><code>Non-UI</code></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>script</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a> } - package.json 中的脚本名, 仅允许字母, 数字及 <code>_.:@/+-</code></li>\n<li><strong>[ directory ]</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a> | <a href=\"dataTypes#null\">null</a> } - 工程目录</li>\n<li><strong>[ options ]</strong> { <a href=\"terminalOpenOptionsType#terminalexecoptions\">TerminalExecOptions</a> }</li>\n<li><ins><strong>returns</strong></ins> { <a href=\"terminalSessionType\">TerminalSession</a> }</li>\n</ul>\n<p>相当于运行 <code>npm run &lt;script&gt;</code>. <code>directory</code> 与 <code>options.cwd</code> 同时传入且不相同时, 抛出 <code>INVALID_ARGUMENT</code>. 仅使用第三个参数时, 第二个参数可传 <code>null</code>.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"lang-js\">let task = terminal.npm.run(&#39;build&#39;, &#39;/sdcard/MyProject&#39;, {\n    keepOpen: false, wait: true, timeout: 600000,\n});\nconsole.log(task.exitCode);\n</code></pre>\n",
              "type": "module",
              "displayName": "terminal.npm.run(script, directory?, options?)"
            },
            {
              "textRaw": "terminal.npm.runAsync(script, directory?, options?)",
              "name": "terminal.npm.runasync(script,_directory?,_options?)",
              "desc": "<p><strong><code>6.8.0</code></strong> <strong><code>Async</code></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>script</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a> }</li>\n<li><strong>[ directory ]</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a> | <a href=\"dataTypes#null\">null</a> }</li>\n<li><strong>[ options ]</strong> { <a href=\"terminalOpenOptionsType#terminalexecoptions\">TerminalExecOptions</a> }</li>\n<li><ins><strong>returns</strong></ins> { <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Global_Objects/Promise\">Promise</a>&lt;<a href=\"terminalSessionType\">TerminalSession</a>&gt; }</li>\n</ul>\n<p><code>npm.run</code> 的异步形态.</p>\n",
              "type": "module",
              "displayName": "terminal.npm.runAsync(script, directory?, options?)"
            }
          ],
          "type": "module",
          "displayName": "[p+] npm"
        },
        {
          "textRaw": "[m] env",
          "name": "[m]_env",
